=head1 DESCRIPTION

This structure displays the results of one feature evaluation
assignment to one user session.

=head1 ATTRIBUTES


=head2 Details => Str

If this user was assigned to a launch or experiment, this field lists
the launch or experiment name.


=head2 B<REQUIRED> EntityId => Str

An internal ID that represents a unique user session of the
application.


=head2 B<REQUIRED> Feature => Str

The name of the feature being evaluated.


=head2 Project => Str

The name or ARN of the project that contains the feature being
evaluated.


=head2 Reason => Str

Specifies the reason that the user session was assigned this variation.
Possible values include C<DEFAULT>, meaning the user was served the
default variation; C<LAUNCH_RULE_MATCH>, if the user session was
enrolled in a launch; or C<EXPERIMENT_RULE_MATCH>, if the user session
was enrolled in an experiment.


=head2 Value => L<Paws::Evidently::VariableValue>

The value assigned to this variation to differentiate it from the other
variations of this feature.


=head2 Variation => Str

The name of the variation that was served to the user session.



